# the float conversions go through `snprintf`, which is the first user of `#[core: variadic_args]` -
# so this case is also what pins that the pack reaches C correctly

--- OUT --->
plain 42
hex 2a upper 2A binary 101010 octal 52
right |      42|
left  |42      |
mid   |   42   |
default 3.14159265358979
fixed 3.14
sci 3.142e+00
sig 3.142
text |     Ronon|
cut |Ron|
neg |    -7|
empty 42
